# Sprint 2 Report (03/01/2026 - 04/04/2026)

## What's New (User Facing)
 * Standard messaging with text and poll media type
 * Friends board and request
 * Improve user flow for trip and event creation
 * Improve UI style for a more plesant experience
 * Implement in app notification for messages

## Work Summary (Developer Facing)
For this sprint, we mostly streamline our data type structures across the frontend and backend. This made possible by switching from javacript code to typescript code for guarantee data access, avoid runtime error for getting data from the backend. 
We also implement a way to manage "rooms" for websocket on the backend. This allows for multiple conversation being handled rather than only one websoket at a time.
We go back to our diagram and streamline the app flow of trip and event management

